<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Francis, Duke of Teck</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1837">1837</a>–<a href="/years/1900">1900</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Francis, Duke of Teck, was the son of Duke Alexander of Württemberg and a Hungarian countess; because of this unequal marriage he was excluded from the Württemberg succession. He was created Prince of Teck in 1863 and Duke of Teck in 1871. In 1866 he married Princess Mary Adelaide of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cambridge">Cambridge</a> and settled in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/england">England</a>, and their daughter Mary became Queen consort of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/george-v">George V</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/francis-duke-of-teck.jpg" alt="Francis, Duke of Teck" width="320" height="479" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Alexander Bassano · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Prince_Francis,_Duke_of_Teck.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>Württemberg later took the ducal title, and in 1871 it was revived for <b>Francis of Teck</b>, father of Queen Mary of Great Britain.</blockquote><a href="/state/duchy-of-teck">Duchy of Teck</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/osijek">Osijek</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/croatia">Croatia</a>. Died in White Lodge, in what is now <a href="/countries/united-kingdom">the United Kingdom</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=45.56,18.67&amp;year=1877" aria-label="Osijek on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4993 557 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Francis, Duke of Teck"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5443 827h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5443 827h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=45.56,18.67&amp;year=1877">What was here in 1877? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
